1
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,360
Get up.

2
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:05,519
Let's go.

3
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:10,320
Boss.

4
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,920
We're alive today

5
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,640
all thanks to Lord Huo's grace.

6
00:01:33,759 --> 00:01:35,160
Translations for various countries.

7
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:37,160
Wishing you a prosperous business.

8
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,479
Sir.

9
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:45,520
I have a very complicated deal here.

10
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,250
I wonder if we can talk about it.

11
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,800
Just say what you want to say, sir.

12
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,600
I can do

13
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:51,180
any kind of business here.

14
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,120
Forging identities.

15
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:57,920
Who are you?

16
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,180
I won't do anything that gets me shot.

17
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,960
I'm just here to ask you for some information.

18
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,000
I don't offer that service here.

19
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,259
If you keep this up, I'll call the police.

20
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,400
I am the police.

21
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,920
I wonder if you've seen him.

22
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,220
His name is Huo Qishan.

23
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,000
I've seen him.

24
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:21,850
He got identities for several countries from me.

25
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,520
Several identities?

26
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:27,400
I...

27
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:35,800
Hello.

28
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:36,720
Siyao.

29
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,320
That old fox Huo Qishan

30
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:40,180
forged several fake identities.

31
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:40,840
I think

32
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:42,560
it's highly unlikely he went to the pier.

33
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,320
We still need to

34
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,650
block all streets leading out of the city.

35
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,040
Huo Qishan won't escape by boat.

36
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,600
Trust me this time.

37
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:58,000
Send someone to Baixiang Lou immediately.

38
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,000
A brothel?

39
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,800
Baixiang Lou is not a brothel.

40
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,760
Then what is it?

41
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,400
Baixiang Lou has a secret tunnel

42
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,400
that leads directly out of the city.

43
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,240
Okay.

44
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,440
What's wrong?

45
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:15,240
Is it not to your taste?

46
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,560
You really are scheming.

47
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,360
Who would have thought that at this time

48
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,400
you would still be at your lover's place?

49
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,600
I am who I am today because of my benefactor.

50
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,800
I can do anything for my benefactor.

51
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:28,400
Ningning,

52
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,920
over the years, I

53
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,320
have done a lot of bad things.

54
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,600
But,

55
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,000
I love you very much.

56
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,320
Love?

57
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,820
Love like yours is worse than killing me.

58
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,360
How about this.

59
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:48,000
After we get out safely,

60
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,560
we'll start over.

61
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:51,640
I will definitely be a good man.

62
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,720
Start over?

63
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:56,560
Don't you think you are being ridiculous?

64
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,240
Since you're not eating,

65
00:03:58,440 --> 00:04:00,000
let's get ready to go.

66
00:04:00,920 --> 00:04:01,720
Yingxiang,

67
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,380
get ready to leave.

68
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,640
Okay.

69
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,440
You won't find Huo Qishan here.

70
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,040
Get in the car.

71
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:12,400
What's going on?

72
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,400
He escaped through the secret passage.

73
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,160
There's no time to explain.

74
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:14,960
Get in the car.

75
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:35,760
Master.

76
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:52,460
Senior Sister.

77
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,520
Little Bandit.

78
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,920
Please let him go.

79
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,640
I didn't take any of his wealth.

80
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,160
Now,

81
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,160
his life is all he has left.

82
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:13,920
Ningning.

83
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,440
Where is our money?

84
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,720
What are you doing?

85
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,440
Everything is gone.

86
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,200
Just go.

87
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,800
Never come back.

88
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,760
Never look back.

89
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:27,840
It's all gone.

90
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:29,000
You.

91
00:05:30,960 --> 00:05:31,760
Don't shoot.

92
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:32,760
Don't shoot.

93
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:33,840
Don't be impulsive,

94
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,640
Ningning.

95
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,600
Huo Qishan,

96
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:36,760
isn't everything you've done

97
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,760
for Ningning?

98
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,159
Think of Ningning.

99
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:39,800
Don't be impulsive.

100
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,600
Huo Qishan,

101
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,720
Ningning is your biological daughter.

102
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,440
Sir,

103
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:44,560
turn back.

104
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:47,240
Li Chengrui.

105
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,850
Senior Brother.

106
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,400
Thank you

107
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,480
for still calling me

108
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,480
Senior Brother.

109
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,400
Zhou Wei,

110
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:28,000
come back.

111
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:30,240
Ningning,

112
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,200
listen to Daddy

113
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:31,960
and come with me.

114
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,200
You are not my dad.

115
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,800
Jiang Siyao,

116
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,840
you did all of this.

117
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,159
I...

118
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,640
Dad.

119
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,520
Ningning.

120
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:16,440
I know you like steamed buns.

121
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,920
Get up and eat them.

122
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,200
Zhou Wei.

123
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:22,480
Zhou Wei.

124
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,360
I beg you.

125
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:26,280
Please wake up.

126
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,520
Welcome, Inspector Zhou. You've officially joined

127
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:26,000
the Phoenix Police Department.

128
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,760
From now on, we'll uphold justice

129
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,600
and protect the people together.

130
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:32,799
Let's lose our heads for justice and the people together.

131
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,860
You look beautiful today.

132
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:18,120
I'm going back to my sect.

133
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,800
I just said goodbye to my senior sister.

134
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:24,600
You're not going to be a police officer anymore?

135
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,000
I still prefer to be free.

136
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,400
Everything is over.

137
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:32,120
Naturally, I'll return to nature.

138
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,800
Then you

139
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,970
won't come down the mountain anymore?

140
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,080
Before I come out of seclusion next time,

141
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:51,080
who knows how many months it will be.

142
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:52,040
Today,

143
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,060
I have to eat my fill of these buns.

144
00:09:59,000 --> 00:09:59,800
Eat.

145
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,780
Delicious, right?

146
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,640
There's something I've always wanted to ask you.

147
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:08,440
Ask away.

148
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,650
That day at the San Faci Winery,

149
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:13,260
why did you choose Lin Jinwen to stay with you

150
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:14,760
instead of me?

151
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:18,360
Because I still had something to say to him.

152
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,440
What was it?

153
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:20,840
To tell him

154
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,160
that I forgave him.

155
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,570
But that doesn't mean I'll accept him.

156
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:34,640
I'm leaving.

157
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,090
Where are you going?

158
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:39,240
To buy you some pineapple cakes.
